The files under this directory (weights/) - ONNX graphs, deploy.yaml, scene.xml
and the accompanying evaluation reports - are NOT covered by the MIT License
that applies to the source code of this repository.

The base model weights (dual_v3b) were trained on motion data derived from:

  - LAFAN1 (Ubisoft La Forge), licensed under Creative Commons
    Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0):
    https://github.com/ubisoft/ubisoft-laforge-animation-dataset
  - AMASS (Max Planck Institute for Intelligent Systems), whose license permits
    use for non-commercial scientific research purposes only:
    https://amass.is.tue.mpg.de/license.html

The skill weights (getup_vpd_ft) were trained on the get-up / lie-down
reference trajectories in apps/ref/skills/, which are reconstructed from the
built-in get-up / lie-down motions of the Q1 robot's motion controller. The
rights to those motions remain with the robot vendor. If the vendor considers
this release to infringe its rights, please open an issue at
https://github.com/brucecai-2001/LocoInfra/issues and the trajectories, the
skill weights and the related features will be removed.

