     built from or incorporating them (including fine-tuned or distilled
     models), may be used only for non-commercial research and education.
     Commercial use of any kind is not permitted.
  2. Upstream terms. Your use must also comply with the license terms of
     LAFAN1 and AMASS (including the licenses of the individual AMASS
     sub-datasets). Where those terms are more restrictive than CC BY-NC 4.0,
     they prevail.
  3. Attribution. Publications or works using the weights must cite this
     repository as well as LAFAN1 and AMASS as requested by their authors.
  4. The robot model referenced by scene.xml (q1/q1_v3) remains the property of
     its respective owners.

